{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25792","headline":"七年初到洛阳寓居宣教里时已春暮而四老俱在洛中分司 · 李绅","name":"七年初到洛阳寓居宣教里时已春暮而四老俱在洛中分司","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青莎满地无三径，白发缘头忝四人。\n官职谬齐商岭客，姓名那重汉廷臣。\n圣朝寡罪容衰齿，愚叟多慙未退身。\n惟有门人怜钝拙，劝教沈醉洛阳春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}